{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One side of a given triangle is 18 inches. Inside the triangle a line segment is drawn parallel to this side forming a trapezoid \nwhose area is one-third of that of the triangle. The length of this segment, in inches, is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2561e93c18cc09a068da02c9874e73b6ba1883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6\\sqrt {6} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 9\\sqrt {2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 12 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ 6\\sqrt{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"456\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bed65b9e0588f71e6273d54d6c94ed70701e93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(18,0)); dot((0,0)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (-1.5,-0.5)); dot((18,0)); label(&quot;B&quot;,(19.5,-0.5));  label(&quot;$18$&quot;, (9,-1.5));  draw((0,0)--(5,10)--(18,0)); dot((5,10)); label(&quot;E&quot;, (6,11.5));  draw((0.918,1.835)--(15.615,1.835)); dot((0.918,1.835)); label(&quot;D&quot;, (-0.65,2.25)); dot((15.615,1.835)); label(&quot;C&quot;, (17.25,2.25));  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p>Let the given triangle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a51ae1b207bc5be14004f5ac59327827f3a3925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. Also, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa42206f3f61ca23ced56914af289d519b27c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD} \\parallel \\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e8bc36793a7c64d05fff20d519f0f72d9256fab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AE}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />. We know from the problem that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/a/5aa919c1a7372dd56a32118eee14c142f4a9848c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABCD]=\\frac{1}{3}[\\triangle ABE]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51ec9041a999198e7444d9b4fb0479ac705bdad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\triangle DCE]=\\frac{2}{3}[\\triangle ABE]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a56edce8f78dc43ce0dd6ed37eb750a9e818f42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DC} \\parallel \\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be3b4f49dff3623104c1a84363608c435026917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DCE \\sim \\triangle ABE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" /> by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AA_similarity\" title=\"AA similarity\">AA similarity</a>. Because the ratio of these two triangles' areas is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, the ratio of their sides must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f7d4901b7c60ad902c489071210d655a73304a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"85\" height=\"45\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aad73b24fb253feebec5e9dbe1df28ce6280c98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}AB=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}*18=\\boxed{6\\sqrt{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"269\" height=\"43\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"19